{"3075240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Finding Your Way", "steam_appid": 3075240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8992b97fa2a622abc04a61582416fdf7.avif?t=1782935401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras_big/8992b97fa2a622abc04a61582416fdf7.webp?t=1782935401 width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a world you once knew, now shrouded in darkness. Splash it with color to reveal your path forward through the invisible levels, and turn it into beautiful artwork as you play. Restore this dreamy realm's forgotten beauty and light as you uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.poster.avif?t=1782935401\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.webm?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.mp4?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/4a61819a2fccfa242c0ac0fa46935aca.avif?t=1782935401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras_big/4a61819a2fccfa242c0ac0fa46935aca.webp?t=1782935401 width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse over 30 mind-bending locations, solve intriguing puzzles, and face powerful bosses. Every step brings you closer to the source of the mysterious darkness. As you progress, you will gain new abilities that allow you to paint in new fun ways and discover a kaleidoscope of powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.poster.avif?t=1782935401\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.webm?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.mp4?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/dfdc6f06cdafacb6d2d8fc34cb801d09.avif?t=1782935401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras_big/dfdc6f06cdafacb6d2d8fc34cb801d09.webp?t=1782935401 width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel alongside your spirit guide, Phoebe, who knew you in your past. Bring back balance, color, and life to this enchanting dreamscape by <i>Finding Your Way</i> forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.poster.avif?t=1782935401\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.webm?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.mp4?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Finding Your Way</i> is a unique experience designed by Ben James and, the writer of <i>Kentucky Route Zero</i>, Jake Elliot.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8992b97fa2a622abc04a61582416fdf7.avif?t=1782935401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras_big/8992b97fa2a622abc04a61582416fdf7.webp?t=1782935401 width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through a world you once knew, now shrouded in darkness. Splash it with color to reveal your path forward through the invisible levels, and turn it into beautiful artwork as you play. Restore this dreamy realm's forgotten beauty and light as you uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.poster.avif?t=1782935401\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.webm?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/8e279e23b7c5da9d8357adb970f5a5be.mp4?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/4a61819a2fccfa242c0ac0fa46935aca.avif?t=1782935401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras_big/4a61819a2fccfa242c0ac0fa46935aca.webp?t=1782935401 width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse over 30 mind-bending locations, solve intriguing puzzles, and face powerful bosses. Every step brings you closer to the source of the mysterious darkness. As you progress, you will gain new abilities that allow you to paint in new fun ways and discover a kaleidoscope of powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.poster.avif?t=1782935401\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.webm?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/704c0f5ef5ba0a22a4d2e0f8dc121ead.mp4?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/dfdc6f06cdafacb6d2d8fc34cb801d09.avif?t=1782935401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras_big/dfdc6f06cdafacb6d2d8fc34cb801d09.webp?t=1782935401 width=1560 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel alongside your spirit guide, Phoebe, who knew you in your past. Bring back balance, color, and life to this enchanting dreamscape by <i>Finding Your Way</i> forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.poster.avif?t=1782935401\" width=798 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.webm?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/extras/16ec5c9cec80fa44c2a411e8bbe5bdf9.mp4?t=1782935401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Finding Your Way</i> is a unique experience designed by Ben James and, the writer of <i>Kentucky Route Zero</i>, Jake Elliot.</p>", "short_description": "Rediscover a familiar world by splashing it with color and find your way through the darkness in this first-person exploration game. Traverse 30+ surreal locations, solve intriguing puzzles, and face your demons. Uncover fragments of your story through a meditative journey between light and shadow.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/675db75b514149f265c7660777d076c6bc24c404/header.jpg?t=1782935401", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/8c75f4d09d22e1a1dae294d903e385176669f639/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782935401", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3075240/8c75f4d09d22e1a1dae294d903e385176669f639/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782935401", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</st